---
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-24">
  <div class="sect-grid"></div>
  <div class="sect-orb absolute bottom-0 right-10 h-[300px] w-[300px] bg-primary-200/10 opacity-30"></div>
  
  <div class="page-shell relative z-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">The Mechanics</span>
      <h2 class="section-title mt-4">From signals to actions in one operating loop.</h2>
      <p class="section-copy mt-6">
        VoluChat coordinates your Shopify catalog details, order parameters, inventory alerts, and customer chats to drive growth loops with minimal manual friction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The 4-Step Process Timeline/Flow -->
    <div class="mt-20 relative">
      <!-- Desktop Line -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block absolute top-[47px] left-10 right-10 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-200 via-primary-300 to-stone-200" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      
      <div class="grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
          <div class="flex h-[94px] w-[94px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-md z-10">
            <span class="text-3xl">🔌</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Step 01</span>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2">Connect</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Plug in Shopify catalog, order databases, inventory alerts, web events, SMS/WhatsApp numbers, and Instagram channels.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
          <div class="flex h-[94px] w-[94px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-md z-10">
            <span class="text-3xl">🧠</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Step 02</span>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2">Understand</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              VoluChat synthesizes customer history, cart parameters, and active sizing queries to build continuous behavior context.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
          <div class="flex h-[94px] w-[94px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-md z-10">
            <span class="text-3xl">⚖️</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Step 03</span>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2">Decide</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              The AI analyzes margin health and inventory age before recommending the next action, governed by guardrails.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left">
          <div class="flex h-[94px] w-[94px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-md z-10">
            <span class="text-3xl">🚀</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6">
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-primary-700 uppercase tracking-widest">Step 04</span>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mt-2">Execute</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Launch targeted customer chats, WhatsApp templates, segmentation campaigns, custom offers, or queue actions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
